      }
    },
    {
      "entryId": "2ti-3-1",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "The Spirit's forecast of savage seasons. First principle: perilous times are listed, not lamented — nineteen traits follow, and the forecast is itself the comfort that none of it is off-script.",
      "density": 2.2036,
      "words": 31,
      "sentences": 2,
      "maxSentenceWords": 25,
      "gate": "PASS",
      "violations": [],
      "context": {
        "citations": []
      }
    },
    {
      "entryId": "2ti-4-18",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "Deliverance from every evil work, preservation to the kingdom, glory forever. First principle: the final rescue is preservation through, not exemption from — unto the heavenly kingdom is the destination of the delivered.",
      "density": 2.0821,
      "words": 33,
      "sentences": 2,
      "maxSentenceWords": 22,
      "gate": "PASS",
      "violations": [],
      "context": {
        "citations": []
      }
    },
    {
      "entryId": "2ti-2-12",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "Suffering-reign and denial-denial are twin laws. First principle: the throne has an entry exam written in endurance; denial has its own symmetry, but the faithful Lord is faithful still.",
      "density": 2.0393,
      "words": 29,
      "sentences": 2,
      "maxSentenceWords": 23,
      "gate": "PASS",
      "violations": [],
      "context": {
        "citations": []
      }
    },
    {
      "entryId": "2ti-3-12",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "The universal suffering law of godliness. First principle: persecution is not an exception clause — it is the promised climate; Jesus told His own the world hated Him first.",
      "density": 2.0393,
      "words": 29,
      "sentences": 2,
      "maxSentenceWords": 23,
      "gate": "PASS",
      "violations": [],
      "context": {
        "citations": []
      }
    },
    {
      "entryId": "2ti-1-12",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "Persuaded He can keep the deposit against that day. First principle: assurance is personal — not what I believe but whom; the deposit is kept by the Keeper against the Day.",
      "density": 2.0321,
      "words": 31,
      "sentences": 2,
      "maxSentenceWords": 22,
      "gate": "PASS",
      "violations": [],
      "context": {
        "citations": []
      }
    },
    {
      "entryId": "2ti-4-8",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "The righteous Judge gives the crown to all who love His appearing. First principle: the crown is laid up, not won — given at that day by the righteous Judge to appearing-lovers everywhere.",
      "density": 2.025,
      "words": 33,
      "sentences": 2,
      "maxSentenceWords": 21,
      "gate": "PASS",
      "violations": [],
      "context": {
        "citations": []
      }
    },
    {
      "entryId": "2ti-2-19",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "The double seal: the Lord knows His own; namers of the name depart from iniquity. First principle: election and ethics are sealed together — known by God, departing from sin; Numbers' rebellion is the backdrop.",
      "density": 2.0179,
      "words": 35,
      "sentences": 2,
      "maxSentenceWords": 20,
      "gate": "PASS",
      "violations": [],
      "context": {
        "citations": []
      }
    },
    {
      "entryId": "2ti-3-15",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "Childhood scripture knowledge aims at salvation through faith. First principle: the Scriptures are salvifically sufficient as far as Christ — the sacred letters point to the faith that saves.",
      "density": 1.925,
      "words": 29,
      "sentences": 2,
      "maxSentenceWords": 21,
      "gate": "PASS",
      "violations": [],
      "context": {
        "citations": []
      }
    },
    {
      "entryId": "2ti-2-8",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "The gospel in one line: Davidic Seed, risen. First principle: the resurrection proves the royal line kept its promise — Romans 1's thesis compressed for a suffering missionary.",
      "density": 1.8429,
      "words": 28,
      "sentences": 2,
      "maxSentenceWords": 20,
      "gate": "PASS",
      "violations": [],
      "context": {
        "citations": []
      }
    },
    {
      "entryId": "2ti-4-1",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "I charge you before God and Christ Jesus who shall judge the quick and the dead at His appearing. First principle: ministry is accountable to the returning Judge.",
      "density": 1.7857,
      "words": 28,
      "sentences": 2,
      "maxSentenceWords": 19,
      "gate": "PASS",
      "violations": [],
      "context": {
        "citations": []
      }
    },
    {
      "entryId": "2ti-1-10",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "The appearing of the Savior illuminated the abolished death. First principle: the gospel switches the light on immortality — Isaiah's swallowed-up death is now an abolished one, revealed.",
      "density": 1.7857,
      "words": 28,
      "sentences": 2,
      "maxSentenceWords": 19,
      "gate": "PASS",
      "violations": [],
      "context": {
        "citations": []
      }
    },
    {
      "entryId": "2ti-3-8",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "The unnamed Egyptian magicians are named here — counterfeit workers resist truth. First principle: Moses had his magicians; the last days have theirs — corrupt minds replicate the opposition pattern.",
      "density": 1.7786,
      "words": 30,
      "sentences": 2,
      "maxSentenceWords": 18,
      "gate": "PASS",
      "violations": [],
      "context": {
        "citations": []
      }
    },
    {
      "entryId": "2ti-3-16",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "All Scripture is given by inspiration of God and is profitable. First principle: the written Word is the Spirit's breath — authoritative, sufficient, and equipping.",
